!research/company/README.md
secrets/
.yamco_tmp/

# Deploy staging artifacts + scratch (2026-09-07). These are build byproducts of
# the ship flow, not source: the .tgz archives are what gets curl'd to the NAS,
# the .diff files are review scratch, _to_delete/ holds dirs the device bridge
# could not rm, and "Claude outputs/" is session scratch.
*.tgz
*_changes.diff
_to_delete/
_probe_write.txt
Claude outputs/
